      ":question/problem": "Find $k$, if $4{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=0$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
